{"seq":1,"slug":"blocking-nonblocking-io-models-multiplexing","title":"Linux IO 模型谱系：阻塞、非阻塞与 IO 多路复用（select/poll/epoll）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/io-uring-linux-high-performance-async-io-engineering/io-model-evolution-syscall-cost/blocking-nonblocking-io-models-multiplexing","wordCount":3204,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"linux-io-模型谱系-阻塞-非阻塞与-io-多路复用-select-poll-epoll\">Linux IO 模型谱系：阻塞、非阻塞与 IO 多路复用（select/poll/epoll）</h1><p>一个 4 核 8GB 的机器，用阻塞式 <code>read</code> 加线程池，为什么在 3000 并发连接时 qps 开始塌方，而 <code>strace</code> 里每个请求的耗时看起来又一个都不高？答案不在业务代码里，而在于每次 IO 都要经过一次用户态到内核态的<strong>特权级切换</strong>，以及为等待数据就绪付出的<strong>调度成本</strong>。Linux 几十年里演化出的五种 IO 模型、三代多路复用接口，都在回答同一个问题：如何让等待的代价不随连接数线性增长。这条谱系也是理解 io_uring 共享环与 SQE/CQE 为什么能把每 IO 系统调用摊薄到接近于零的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-一次-io-到底花在哪里\">核心概念：一次 IO 到底花在哪里</h2><p>一次网络 <code>read</code> 在内核里被拆成两个阶段。<strong>第一阶段是等待数据到达</strong>：网卡收到包、DMA 写入内核环形缓冲区、协议栈处理、数据进入 socket 的接收队列。<strong>第二阶段是把数据从内核缓冲区拷贝到用户缓冲区</strong>。阻塞与非阻塞、同步与异步，全部是对这两阶段「谁来等、谁来拷」的不同安排。</p>\n<p>从系统调用角度看，一次 <code>read</code> 的固定成本包含：<code>syscall</code> 指令触发的模式切换（保存/恢复寄存器、切换栈、刷新部分流水线）、内核中 VFS 到 socket 层的函数调用链、以及对文件描述符的权限与状态检查。这条链路本身在纳秒到微秒量级，但它有一个放大效应：<strong>等待期间线程被阻塞，调度器必须把它从 CPU 上换下，数据就绪后再换回</strong>，两次上下文切换的代价远高于系统调用本身。把 IO 的总吞吐写成粗略模型：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>req</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>syscall</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>wait</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>copy</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>switch</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{req}} = T_{\\text{syscall}} + T_{\\text{wait}} + T_{\\text{copy}} + T_{\\text{switch}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">req</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">syscall</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">wait</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">copy</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">switch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当并发连接数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 增长而每连接数据稀疏（典型长连接场景）时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>wait</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{wait}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">wait</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 才是主导项。<strong>阻塞模型把 <code>wait</code> 摊给了线程</strong>，所以需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个线程；<strong>多路复用把 <code>wait</code> 收归到一个或少数几个线程</strong>，用一次系统调用同时等待 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个 fd，从而把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>switch</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum T_{\\text{switch}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">switch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 压成常数级。这就是 C10K 问题（Dan Kegel 于 1999 年提出并维护的「The C10K problem」页面，man7.org 与 kegel.com/c10k 有存档）的真正内核：不是「能不能连上 10000 个」，而是「等待这 10000 个连接的代价由谁承担」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[用户进程发起 read] --&gt; B{内核: 数据是否已就绪}&#10;  B --&gt;|未就绪| C[阶段一: 等待数据]&#10;  B --&gt;|已就绪| E[阶段二: 内核缓冲 -&gt; 用户缓冲拷贝]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[阻塞模型: 线程睡眠, 调度器换出]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[非阻塞模型: 立即返回 EAGAIN, 用户轮询]&#10;  C --&gt; C3[多路复用: 单线程在 epoll_wait 等待多个 fd]&#10;  C1 --&gt; E&#10;  C2 --&gt; E&#10;  C3 --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[read 返回, 业务处理]&#10;&#10;  subgraph 五种模型的本质差别&#10;    C1&#10;    C2&#10;    C3&#10;  end\">flowchart TD\n  A[用户进程发起 read] --&gt; B{内核: 数据是否已就绪}\n  B --&gt;|未就绪| C[阶段一: 等待数据]\n  B --&gt;|已就绪| E[阶段二: 内核缓冲 -&gt; 用户缓冲拷贝]\n  C --&gt; C1[阻塞模型: 线程睡眠, 调度器换出]\n  C --&gt; C2[非阻塞模型: 立即返回 EAGAIN, 用户轮询]\n  C --&gt; C3[多路复用: 单线程在 epoll_wait 等待多个 fd]\n  C1 --&gt; E\n  C2 --&gt; E\n  C3 --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[read 返回, 业务处理]\n\n  subgraph 五种模型的本质差别\n    C1\n    C2\n    C3\n  end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>阶段一等待由谁承担</th>\n<th>阶段二拷贝由谁完成</th>\n<th>单线程可管理连接数</th>\n<th>典型系统调用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>阻塞 IO</td>\n<td>线程（睡眠）</td>\n<td>用户线程触发，内核拷贝</td>\n<td>1（每线程 1 连接）</td>\n<td><code>read</code> 阻塞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非阻塞 IO</td>\n<td>用户线程（轮询）</td>\n<td>用户线程触发，内核拷贝</td>\n<td>多，但空转烧 CPU</td>\n<td><code>read</code> + <code>O_NONBLOCK</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IO 多路复用</td>\n<td>内核（就绪通知）</td>\n<td>用户线程触发，内核拷贝</td>\n<td>数千至数万</td>\n<td><code>select</code>/<code>poll</code>/<code>epoll_wait</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信号驱动 IO</td>\n<td>内核（SIGIO）</td>\n<td>用户线程触发，内核拷贝</td>\n<td>多，但信号处理复杂</td>\n<td><code>fcntl</code> + <code>SIGIO</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异步 IO</td>\n<td>内核（全程）</td>\n<td>内核完成后再通知</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td><code>io_uring</code> / <code>aio</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>需要特别指出：<strong>前三行在多路复用狭义定义下仍属「同步 IO」</strong>，因为阶段二的拷贝仍由用户线程在数据就绪后主动发起。POSIX 意义上的真异步要求两个阶段都由内核完成并只通知结果——这正是 <code>io_uring</code> 与 AIO 的定位。混淆「非阻塞」与「异步」是初学这类接口时最常见的概念滑坡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"select-与-poll-把等待收拢-却留下了-o-n\">select 与 poll：把等待收拢，却留下了 O(n)</h2><p><code>select</code> 的接口形态是三个 <code>fd_set</code> 位图加一个超时值，<code>man 2 select</code> 明确规定 <code>FD_SETSIZE</code> 默认为 1024，且该值在编译期固化——一个 <code>fd_set</code> 是固定长度的位集合，进程只能在其中标记小于 <code>FD_SETSIZE</code> 的 fd。这一限制不是实现疏忽，而是接口设计的结构性后果：位图大小必须编译期确定。<code>poll</code> 用 <code>struct pollfd</code> 数组取代位图，取消了 1024 的天花板，代价是调用者要维护数组与 fd 的一一对应。</p>\n<p>两者共享同一类性能问题。每次 <code>select</code>/<code>poll</code> 调用，内核必须<strong>把整个 fd 集合从用户地址空间拷贝进内核</strong>，再<strong>线性扫描</strong>每一个 fd 检查就绪状态，单次调用的内核侧开销是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>check</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>copy</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n) \\cdot c_{\\text{check}} + O(n) \\cdot c_{\\text{copy}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">check</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">copy</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 为管理的 fd 数）。在稀疏活跃场景下（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = 10000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10000</span></span></span></span></span> 而每次只有个位数 fd 就绪），99.9% 的扫描被浪费。更糟的是这个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> <strong>每次调用都重复</strong>：<code>select</code> 返回后用户程序必须重新遍历整个集合找出就绪项、重建集合并传入下一次调用——内核并不知道「上次是谁就绪的」，于是形成内核扫一遍、用户再扫一遍的双重线性。<code>man 2 select</code> 的 BUGS 段落直白记录了这一点：返回后三个集合都被就地修改，调用者必须保存原始集合并在每次调用前恢复。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比项</th>\n<th>select</th>\n<th>poll</th>\n<th>epoll</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据结构</td>\n<td>位图 <code>fd_set</code></td>\n<td><code>struct pollfd</code> 数组</td>\n<td>红黑树 + 就绪链表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大 fd 数</td>\n<td>受 <code>FD_SETSIZE</code>（默认 1024）限制</td>\n<td>仅受 <code>RLIMIT_NOFILE</code> 限制</td>\n<td>仅受 <code>RLIMIT_NOFILE</code> 限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每次调用开销</td>\n<td>O(n) 拷贝 + O(n) 扫描</td>\n<td>O(n) 拷贝 + O(n) 扫描</td>\n<td>O(1) 拷贝就绪项 + O(就绪数)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内核注册是否持久</td>\n<td>否，每次重建</td>\n<td>否，每次重建</td>\n<td>是，<code>epoll_ctl</code> 一次注册长期有效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>就绪集合是否需要用户重扫</td>\n<td>需要</td>\n<td>需要</td>\n<td>不需要，<code>epoll_wait</code> 直接返回就绪项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引入版本</td>\n<td>早于 POSIX，SVR4/BSD 均有</td>\n<td>Linux 2.1.23</td>\n<td>Linux 2.5.44 起可用，2.6 稳定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>poll</code> 相对 <code>select</code> 的进步是工程性的而非算法性的：它解决了个别 fd 值大于 1024 时的可用性问题，但没有改变每次调用都要把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个项拷进内核并扫描的事实。所以当连接数从几百涨到几万，两者的表现会一起崩塌——差别只是崩在哪条曲线上。<code>select</code> 还额外背着一个隐蔽缺陷：返回后的集合是就地修改的，多线程或多处代码复用时极易出现「忘记重建集合导致漏检 fd」的 bug，这类缺陷在 <code>man 2 select</code> 里被专门警告。</p>\n<h2 id=\"epoll-把注册与等待分离-让就绪事件主动排队\">epoll：把注册与等待分离，让就绪事件主动排队</h2><p><code>epoll</code> 的关键设计选择是<strong>把「注册」与「等待」两个动作拆开</strong>。<code>epoll_create1</code> 创建内核事件对象，<code>epoll_ctl</code> 把感兴趣的 fd 连同事件掩码注册进去（底层是红黑树，增删查 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>），<code>epoll_wait</code> 只做一件事：从<strong>就绪链表</strong>取出已发生事件的 fd。这份就绪链表不是 <code>epoll_wait</code> 时扫描算出来的，而是<strong>由事件回调在数据到达时主动挂钩上去的</strong>——socket 收到数据、协议栈回调触发时就把对应 <code>epitem</code> 挂入就绪链。因此 <code>epoll_wait</code> 的开销只与实际就绪的 fd 数成正比，与注册总数无关。10 万连接里平均 100 个活跃，<code>select</code>/<code>poll</code> 每次处理 10 万项，<code>epoll_wait</code> 只需处理 100 项，代价差三个数量级——这就是 nginx、Redis、Node.js（libuv）、Go runtime netpoller 全部把主循环建在 <code>epoll</code>（FreeBSD/macOS 对应 <code>kqueue</code>，Windows 对应 IOCP）之上的原因。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  U1[注册阶段: epoll_ctl EPOLL_CTL_ADD] --&gt; RB[(内核红黑树&lt;br/&gt;保存所有关注的 fd)]&#10;  NIC[网卡收包 -&gt; 协议栈 -&gt; socket 接收队列] --&gt; CB[socket 就绪回调]&#10;  CB --&gt; RL[(就绪链表&lt;br/&gt;等待被取走的 epitem)]&#10;  RB -.-&gt;|只增删节点| CB&#10;  U2[等待阶段: epoll_wait] --&gt; RL&#10;  RL --&gt;|返回就绪 fd 数组| U3[用户线程逐项处理&lt;br/&gt;read 直到 EAGAIN]&#10;  U3 --&gt;|EPOLLET 边沿触发| DRAIN{是否读到 EAGAIN}&#10;  DRAIN --&gt;|否| U3&#10;  DRAIN --&gt;|是| U4[处理完毕, 回到 epoll_wait]\">flowchart TD\n  U1[注册阶段: epoll_ctl EPOLL_CTL_ADD] --&gt; RB[(内核红黑树&lt;br/&gt;保存所有关注的 fd)]\n  NIC[网卡收包 -&gt; 协议栈 -&gt; socket 接收队列] --&gt; CB[socket 就绪回调]\n  CB --&gt; RL[(就绪链表&lt;br/&gt;等待被取走的 epitem)]\n  RB -.-&gt;|只增删节点| CB\n  U2[等待阶段: epoll_wait] --&gt; RL\n  RL --&gt;|返回就绪 fd 数组| U3[用户线程逐项处理&lt;br/&gt;read 直到 EAGAIN]\n  U3 --&gt;|EPOLLET 边沿触发| DRAIN{是否读到 EAGAIN}\n  DRAIN --&gt;|否| U3\n  DRAIN --&gt;|是| U4[处理完毕, 回到 epoll_wait]</pre><p>用 KaTeX 表达这组接口的核心契约：设注册 fd 总数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>、单次就绪数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>epoll_wait</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>switch</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{epoll\\_wait}} = O(k) + C_{\\text{switch}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">epoll_wait</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">switch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>select</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{select}} = O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">select</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≪</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\ll n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 的稀疏活跃场景下差距随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 增大而拉大。<strong>「epoll 不是更快，而是更可扩展」的精确含义就在于此</strong>：在少数连接全部活跃的密集场景里，<code>epoll_wait</code> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 退化成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，与 <code>poll</code> 的差距缩小到常数因子。选型时把「epoll 一定比 poll 快」当普遍结论，会在连接数小、全部活跃的压测里得到反直觉的结果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"水平触发与边沿触发-epollet-必须读到-eagain\">水平触发与边沿触发：EPOLLET 必须读到 EAGAIN</h2><p><code>epoll</code> 提供两种就绪语义。<strong>水平触发（Level-Triggered，默认）</strong>：只要接收缓冲区还有数据未被读走，<code>epoll_wait</code> 每次都把它报为就绪——语义直观，漏读不丢事件，代价是可能反复唤醒。<strong>边沿触发（<code>EPOLLET</code>）</strong>：只在状态发生「变化」时通知一次，之后即使缓冲区还有数据也不再重复通知。<code>man 7 epoll</code> 对边沿触发给出了明确要求：必须配合非阻塞 fd，并<strong>循环 <code>read</code>/<code>write</code> 直到返回 <code>EAGAIN</code></strong>，否则剩余数据将永远等不到下一次通知，表现就是连接「卡死」——服务端明明收到过数据，却再也没被唤醒。这是 epoll 最经典的工程陷阱：「一次 <code>read</code> 只读到一个包的一部分」在 TCP 字节流下是常态而非例外，一次 <code>EPOLLIN</code> 通知可能对应半个请求头、一个完整请求、或两个粘在一起的请求，所以必须把「读到 <code>EAGAIN</code>」当作一次可读事件的终点。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>触发模式</th>\n<th>通知时机</th>\n<th>是否可能反复唤醒</th>\n<th>用户侧义务</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>EPOLLLT</code>（默认）</td>\n<td>缓冲区非空即通知</td>\n<td>是，可能重复</td>\n<td>可只读一次，下次仍会通知</td>\n<td>逻辑简单、可容忍重复唤醒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>EPOLLET</code></td>\n<td>状态跃迁时通知一次</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>必须循环读到 <code>EAGAIN</code></td>\n<td>高并发、追求最少唤醒次数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>另一个多线程时代的常见缺陷是<strong>惊群（thundering herd）</strong>：多个线程/进程同时 <code>epoll_wait</code> 同一个 epoll 实例或同一个监听 socket，一个连接就绪会唤醒全部等待者，只有一个抢到，其余空转。内核为此提供了两种机制——<code>SO_REUSEPORT</code>（Linux 3.9 起，让每个进程各自持有独立监听 socket，内核按四元组哈希分流）和 <code>EPOLLEXCLUSIVE</code>（Linux 4.5 起，在 <code>epoll_ctl</code> 添加 fd 时指定，保证一个事件只唤醒一个等待者）。二者解决的是不同层次的问题：前者在 socket 层做负载均衡，后者在 epoll 实例层做排他唤醒，不能互相替代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从-每-io-一次系统调用-到-io_uring-的必然\">从「每 IO 一次系统调用」到 io_uring 的必然</h2><p>把这条谱系串起来看，每一代的进步都在削减某一项成本：<code>select</code> 到 <code>poll</code> 削减了 fd 数上限，<code>poll</code> 到 <code>epoll</code> 削减了「等待」的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 扫描，<code>epoll</code> 到 <code>io_uring</code> 则要削减一个此前没被触碰的常数——<strong>每一次 IO 都必须至少一次系统调用</strong>。<code>epoll</code> 模式下处理一个请求的典型序列是 <code>epoll_wait</code> → <code>read</code>（可能多次）→ 计算 → <code>write</code>，其中 <code>epoll_wait</code> 与 <code>read</code>/<code>write</code> 各自都是一次完整的模式切换。在每秒百万级 IO 的场景里，这些切换本身就成了瓶颈。</p>\n<p><code>io_uring</code> 由 Jens Axboe 于 2019 年在 Linux 5.1 引入（见 kernel.org 的 io_uring 文档与 LWN 的系列报道），核心思路是用户态与内核态共享一对环形缓冲区：提交队列（SQ）与完成队列（CQ）。用户程序把操作描述（SQE）写入 SQ 后无需立即进入内核，可批量攒够若干个再通过一次 <code>io_uring_enter</code> 提交；内核完成后把结果（CQE）放进 CQ，用户批量收割。这样 N 次 IO 摊到的是常数级的系统调用次数，把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>syscall</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{syscall}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">syscall</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从「每 IO 一次」变成「每批一次」。本章的下一篇将深入共享环与 SQE/CQE 的内存布局和内存序约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Linux IO 模型的演化不是功能堆叠，而是一条「把等待成本从线程转移到内核、把系统调用从每 IO 一次压到每批一次」的连续路径。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>阻塞模型</strong>把等待摊给线程，编码最直观但每连接一线程，上下文切换在长连接场景下成为瓶颈。</li>\n<li><strong>非阻塞模型</strong>把等待交还给用户轮询，换来的是空转的 CPU 与在用户态重写一遍调度逻辑的复杂度。</li>\n<li><strong>select/poll</strong> 用一次系统调用同时等待多个 fd，但每次调用都要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 拷入并扫描，且 <code>select</code> 受 <code>FD_SETSIZE</code>（默认 1024）的编译期硬限。</li>\n<li><strong>epoll</strong> 通过红黑树注册 + 就绪链表把 <code>epoll_wait</code> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 为就绪数），是 nginx/Redis/libuv/Go netpoller 的共同基座；代价是 <code>EPOLLET</code> 必须读到 <code>EAGAIN</code>、多线程下要处理惊群（<code>SO_REUSEPORT</code> / <code>EPOLLEXCLUSIVE</code>）。</li>\n<li>「非阻塞」不等于「异步」：前三代模型的数据拷贝仍由用户线程发起，真正的异步要求内核完成包括拷贝在内的两个阶段，这正是 <code>io_uring</code> 要解决的问题。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句可带走的判据：<strong>瓶颈是连接数时选 epoll，瓶颈是每秒 IO 次数（系统调用本身）时才轮到 io_uring 出场</strong>，二者的适用边界由活跃度稀疏程度与单次 IO 数据量共同决定，而非「新接口更好」的直觉。</p>\n<p>延伸阅读：本 hub 后续章节 <a href=\"../uring-ring-sqe-cqe-mechanics/\">共享环与 SQE/CQE 机制</a> 与 <a href=\"../perf-tuning-language-bindings-production/\">语言绑定与生产调优</a> 分别展开内核侧内存布局与工程落地。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Linux IO 模型谱系：阻塞、非阻塞与 IO 多路复用（select/poll/epoll）","id":"linux-io-模型谱系-阻塞-非阻塞与-io-多路复用-select-poll-epoll"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：一次 IO 到底花在哪里","id":"核心概念-一次-io-到底花在哪里"},{"level":2,"text":"select 与 poll：把等待收拢，却留下了 O(n)","id":"select-与-poll-把等待收拢-却留下了-o-n"},{"level":2,"text":"epoll：把注册与等待分离，让就绪事件主动排队","id":"epoll-把注册与等待分离-让就绪事件主动排队"},{"level":2,"text":"水平触发与边沿触发：EPOLLET 必须读到 EAGAIN","id":"水平触发与边沿触发-epollet-必须读到-eagain"},{"level":2,"text":"从「每 IO 一次系统调用」到 io_uring 的必然","id":"从-每-io-一次系统调用-到-io_uring-的必然"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"系统调用成本模型：上下文切换、用户态/内核态拷贝与每 IO 往返开销量化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/io-uring-linux-high-performance-async-io-engineering/io-model-evolution-syscall-cost/syscall-context-switch-copy-overhead-model"}}